  "body": "Source PRPG Core Rulebook pg. 449\n This is an NPC class and was not given a description.\nHit Die: d6.\nClass Skills\nThe Commoner's class skills are Climb (Str), Craft (Int), Handle Animal (Cha), Perception (Wis), Profession (Wis), Ride (Dex), and Swim (Str).\n\nSkill Points at each Level: 2 + Int modifier.\nClass Features\nLevel Base Attack Bonus Fort Save Ref Save Will Save Special\n1st +0 +0 +0 +0 —\n2nd +1 +0 +0 +0 —\n3rd +1 +1 +1 +1 —\n4th +2 +1 +1 +1 —\n5th +2 +1 +1 +1 —\n6th +3 +2 +2 +2 —\n7th +3 +2 +2 +2 —\n8th +4 +2 +2 +2 —\n9th +4 +3 +3 +3 —\n10th +5 +3 +3 +3 —\n11th +5 +3 +3 +3 —\n12th +6/+1 +4 +4 +4 —\n13th +6/+1 +4 +4 +4 —\n14th +7/+2 +4 +4 +4 —\n15th +7/+2 +5 +5 +5 —\n16th +8/+3 +5 +5 +5 —\n17th +8/+3 +5 +5 +5 —\n18th +9/+4 +6 +6 +6 —\n19th +9/+4 +6 +6 +6 —\n20th +10/+5 +6 +6 +6 —\n\nWeapon and Armor Proficiency: The commoner is proficient with one simple weapon. He is not proficient with any other weapons, nor is he proficient with any type of armor or shield.\nFavored Class Options\nKitsune (Blood of the Beast pg. 12): Gain 1/6 of a new Magical TailARG feat. Any kitsune character can choose this bonus upon gaining a level in her favored class.",
